### Key design decisions
- Frontend is vanilla JS (no framework) — avoids build tooling complexity
- SSE for real-time updates instead of polling
- JSONL-based storage for simplicity (append-only, atomic rewrites)
- Queue manager uses EventEmitter pattern for loose coupling with SSE

