## Mission 002: Upgrade SARAB — Projects, Sessions & Settings

### Phase 1 — Discovery Audit (2026-05-08)

**Current architecture summary**:
- Flat JSONL storage: `data/jobs.jsonl` (append + atomic rewrite with uuid tmp), `data/logs/<id>.log`
- Single `ClaudeExecutor` via `spawn("claude", ["-p", prompt])` — no session support, no cwd
- Factory-function API route pattern: `createXxxRouter(dep1, dep2)` returning Express Router
- Manual DI in `server.ts` — linear, no container
- Vanilla JS SPA: render-on-navigate, full innerHTML replacement, global mutable state
- 43 Playwright + 16 smoke tests — all passing, test server auto-started via playwright.config.ts

**Gaps to fill**:
- No project concept — all jobs are global, no root path for execution
- No session capture — Claude session IDs are lost after each execution
- No session resume — `claude --resume` never used
- No prompt editing/duplicating/rerunning — only create, cancel, retry, delete
- Prompt improvement (`src/api/prompt.ts`) uses Claude CLI executor, not DeepSeek API
- No settings system — all config via env vars, hardcoded Claude CLI provider
- No project or session-related tests

**Key risks**:
1. Session ID format from Claude CLI stderr unknown — expected `Session ID: cls_xxx`
2. Frontend `app.js` (~500 lines) will grow substantially with 4+ new views
3. DeepSeek API requires `ANTHROPIC_AUTH_TOKEN` env var
4. Settings system must keep env var backward compatibility

### Phase 2 — Data Model + Storage (2026-05-08)

**Created**:
- `src/queue/types.ts` — extended: `SessionMode` type, `Session`, `Project`, `ProjectCreateInput`, `AIProvider`, `AppSettings` interfaces; `Job` and `JobCreateInput` extended with `projectId`, `sessionId`, `sessionMode`
- `src/storage/projects.ts` — `ProjectStore` (JSONL, same pattern as JobStore)
- `src/storage/sessions.ts` — `SessionStore` (JSONL, with `getLatestForProject`)
- `src/storage/settings.ts` — `SettingsStore` (single JSON file with defaults)
- `src/server.ts` — wired `projectStore`, `sessionStore`, `settingsStore`
- `src/api/router.ts` — accepts new stores, passes them through

**Tested**: 59 tests passing, backward-compatible

### Phase 3 — Session Handling (2026-05-08)

**Modified**:
- `src/executor/types.ts` — added `sessionId`, `cwd` to ExecutorInput; `capturedSessionId` to ExecutorOutput
- `src/executor/claude.ts` — parses stderr for `Session ID: cls_xxx`, supports `--resume` flag, passes `cwd` to spawn
- `src/queue/manager.ts` — accepts `SessionStore`/`ProjectStore`, resolves cwd from project, resolves session from mode, saves captured sessions post-execution
- `src/api/jobs.ts` — accepts `projectId`, `sessionId`, `sessionMode` in create
- `src/storage/jobs.ts` — `create()` maps new fields

**Created**:
