## Remaining skipped items implemented (2026-05-09)

### M1: In-memory job index
- JobStore now uses `Map<string, Job>` cache alongside JSONL file
- `get()` is O(1), `list()` is O(n) but no file I/O
- `create()` adds to cache + appends; `update()`/`delete()` mutate cache + rewrite file
- Cache loaded from JSONL on construction
- Same pattern applicable to ProjectStore/SessionStore (less critical — read less often)

### M6: Pagination
- `GET /api/jobs?limit=N&offset=M` returns `{ jobs, total, limit, offset }`
- When no params: returns flat array (backward compatible)
- Frontend: 25 jobs per page, Prev/Next buttons, page counter
- Page resets to 0 on filter/search change

### L1: Responsive CSS
- Media queries at 768px and 480px breakpoints
- Topbar wraps vertically, nav centers, stats compress to 3→2 columns
- Job table hides Attempt column (768px), Status column (480px)
- Form rows stack vertically, project cards go column layout
- Modal width constrained to 95%

### L3: Concurrency config
- `SARAB_CONCURRENCY` env var (default: 1, backward compatible)
- QueueManager tracks `activeJobs` Set, starts up to N jobs per tick
- Next poll scheduled immediately (doesn't wait for job completion)
- Active count decremented on completion/failure/stop

### Test results: 76 tests, 0 failures
- 60 fast Playwright (8.2s) + 16 smoke

