## Phase 1 — Discovery (2026-05-09)
Issue: [#1](https://github.com/ettersAy/sarab/issues/1) — Audit project, identify where Kanban missions & project-level AI settings should fit.

### 1. Current Architecture Audit

#### Backend Layers (clean separation, no major SRP violations)

| Layer | Files | Status |
|-------|-------|--------|
| Config | `config.ts` (23 lines) | Fine. Env-based, single source of truth. |
| Errors | `errors.ts` (28 lines) | Fine. `AppError` → `NotFoundError`, `ValidationError`. |
| Logger | `logger.ts` (51 lines) | Fine. Console + file, colored output. |
| Executor | `types.ts`, `claude.ts`, `deepseek.ts`, `factory.ts` | Clean. Interface + 2 impls + factory. All under 100 lines each. |
| Storage | `jobs.ts`, `projects.ts`, `sessions.ts`, `settings.ts`, `logs.ts` | Clean. Jobs has in-memory Map cache. Rest read file each call. |
| Queue | `types.ts`, `manager.ts`, `sse.ts` | **types.ts is a dumping ground** (102 lines, all domain types crammed together). manager.ts at 308 lines — acceptable but largest backend file. sse.ts at 60 lines, fine. |
| API | `router.ts`, `jobs.ts`, `projects.ts`, `sessions.ts`, `settings.ts`, `queue.ts`, `prompt.ts` | Clean factory-function pattern. Each router file focused on its domain. |
| Server | `server.ts` (106 lines) | Manual DI wiring, linear and readable. |

#### Frontend (problematic — single God Blob file)

| File | Lines | Status |
|------|-------|--------|
| `web/app.js` | **1177** | **God Blob** — all state, all views, all API helpers, all event handlers in one file. |
| `web/index.html` | 47 | Fine. SPA shell with nav, modal, toast placeholders. |
| `web/styles.css` | — | Dark theme, responsive breakpoints at 768px/480px. |

**app.js SRP violations:**
- State management (11 mutable globals: `jobs`, `projects`, `currentProjectId`, `stats`, `queueFilter`, `queueSearch`, `queueRunning`, `queuePage`, `sessions`, `sessionMode`, `sseConnected`)
- 6 view renderers: `renderDashboard`, `renderProjects`, `renderProjectDetail`, `renderQueue`, `renderSubmit`, `renderSettings`
- 4 form handlers: `showProjectForm`, `showEditProjectForm`, `showAddProviderForm`, `showEditProviderForm`
- ~25 API helper functions
- SSE handling, toast, navigation, utility functions
- All in a single file with no modules

#### Test Coverage

